      "target": "## 学习目标\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "17-22:b0008",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Load Testing LLM APIs — Why k6 and Locust Lie",
        "## Learning Objectives"
      ],
      "ordinal": 4,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "17-22:b0009",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Load Testing LLM APIs — Why k6 and Locust Lie",
        "## Learning Objectives"
      ],
      "ordinal": 5,
      "source_sha256": "5917cb9ef88e0c406c17b9e1bbb5b5d10c0b4c6a48443764096e64b58f01fb95",
      "target": "- 解释使通用负载测试工具对 LLM API（应用程序编程接口）给出误导性结果的两种反模式：GIL 陷阱和提示词单一化陷阱。\n- 根据用途选择工具：LLMPerf（基准测试）、k6 + 流式扩展（CI 门禁）、guidellm（大规模合成测试）、GenAI-Perf（NVIDIA 参考工具）。\n- 设计四种负载模式（稳态、渐增、突增、长时间稳态运行），并指出各自能发现的故障类型。\n- 使用输入 token 数的均值和标准差构造接近真实情况的提示词分布，而不是固定长度。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "17-22:b0010",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Load Testing LLM APIs — Why k6 and Locust Lie",
        "## Learning Objectives"
      ],
      "ordinal": 5,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "17-22:b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Load Testing LLM APIs — Why k6 and Locust Lie",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 6,
      "source_sha256": "f88026ff32dd8f43def76262b9b1e99e1082ea528c571c9922238a9fa88f4fe5",
      "target": "## 要解决的问题\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "17-22:b0012",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Load Testing LLM APIs — Why k6 and Locust Lie",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 6,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "17-22:b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Load Testing LLM APIs — Why k6 and Locust Lie",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 7,
      "source_sha256": "78f5826957c852fc823f04fb233252c857ff0be6d2a496f9722928160c1c8eb1",
      "target": "你用 k6 对 LLM 端点（endpoint）进行了 500 个并发用户的测试。服务撑住了，于是你上线了。然而到了生产环境，200 个真实用户就让服务崩溃：P99 TTFT（首 token 延迟）飙升，GPU 满载。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "17-22:b0014",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Load Testing LLM APIs — Why k6 and Locust Lie",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 7,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "17-22:b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Load Testing LLM APIs — Why k6 and Locust Lie",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 8,
      "source_sha256": "fc8fa68fad2d1b59137a671f0e4b0e9391364be77602fedf17950cec43829bdf",
      "target": "这里发生了两件事。首先，k6 发送了 500 条完全相同的提示词；请求合并和前缀缓存让系统看起来像是在处理 500 路并发解码，实际上只处理了一路。其次，k6 对流式响应 token 间延迟的追踪方式与人实际看到的节奏不同；它看到的是一条 HTTP 连接，而不是以不同时间间隔到达的 500 个 token。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "17-22:b0016",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Load Testing LLM APIs — Why k6 and Locust Lie",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 8,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "17-22:b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Load Testing LLM APIs — Why k6 and Locust Lie",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 9,
      "source_sha256": "4454eac6beb4d7e77d1f22a59d9af1450dd0669ab2283842c1f3fa5c9755bae5",
      "target": "LLM 负载测试需要专门的方法。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "17-22:b0018",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Load Testing LLM APIs — Why k6 and Locust Lie",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 9,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "17-22:b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
