    },
    {
      "segment_id": "17-22:b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Load Testing LLM APIs — Why k6 and Locust Lie",
        "## The Concept",
        "### The GIL trap (Locust)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 11,
      "source_sha256": "d6ba592b77a6947e9d049c6e98df83481f34a41b4542a50f1a94cc32587cf868",
      "target": "### GIL 陷阱（Locust）\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "17-22:b0022",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Load Testing LLM APIs — Why k6 and Locust Lie",
        "## The Concept",
        "### The GIL trap (Locust)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 11,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "17-22:b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Load Testing LLM APIs — Why k6 and Locust Lie",
        "## The Concept",
        "### The GIL trap (Locust)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 12,
      "source_sha256": "43fbef73ce019389c3212eeae6ac1fe0681813fdfcdc0c3c6fc0f8e8648bfe6a",
      "target": "Locust 使用 Python，在客户端的 GIL 下执行分词。高并发时，分词器（tokenizer）的任务排在请求生成之后。报告中的 token 间延迟包含客户端分词积压造成的等待。你以为服务器慢，实际上慢的是测试框架。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "17-22:b0024",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Load Testing LLM APIs — Why k6 and Locust Lie",
        "## The Concept",
        "### The GIL trap (Locust)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 12,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "17-22:b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Load Testing LLM APIs — Why k6 and Locust Lie",
        "## The Concept",
        "### The GIL trap (Locust)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 13,
      "source_sha256": "f283e9b3476b371ee968fbb9c0ea4761f0b444a372dfa700a105cc4ddb7b35a4",
      "target": "解决办法：用 LLM-Locust 扩展将分词移到独立进程，或者使用编译型语言实现的测试框架（k6，或使用 tokenizers.rs 的 LLMPerf）。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "17-22:b0026",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Load Testing LLM APIs — Why k6 and Locust Lie",
        "## The Concept",
        "### The GIL trap (Locust)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 13,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "17-22:b0027",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Load Testing LLM APIs — Why k6 and Locust Lie",
        "## The Concept",
        "### The prompt-uniformity trap"
      ],
      "ordinal": 14,
      "source_sha256": "25cee20a8cb181e18763d4007f2d71455b85e060cb4a842e9f05db7b14250c85",
      "target": "### 提示词单一化陷阱\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "17-22:b0028",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Load Testing LLM APIs — Why k6 and Locust Lie",
        "## The Concept",
        "### The prompt-uniformity trap"
      ],
      "ordinal": 14,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "17-22:b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Load Testing LLM APIs — Why k6 and Locust Lie",
        "## The Concept",
        "### The prompt-uniformity trap"
      ],
      "ordinal": 15,
      "source_sha256": "ec3836bc4f3b8939f4685c9d8992fda68fb3ae54de17f758bfe99bafa0a85ae2",
      "target": "所有已知的负载测试工具都允许配置一条提示词。在循环 10,000 次的测试中，每次都发送同一条提示词。服务器每次看到的前缀相同，前缀缓存命中率接近 100%，吞吐量看起来很好。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "17-22:b0030",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Load Testing LLM APIs — Why k6 and Locust Lie",
        "## The Concept",
        "### The prompt-uniformity trap"
      ],
      "ordinal": 15,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "17-22:b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Load Testing LLM APIs — Why k6 and Locust Lie",
        "## The Concept",
        "### The prompt-uniformity trap"
      ],
      "ordinal": 16,
      "source_sha256": "2cf7345ffb1f06ece91202199002b8bf4009e6331bfab233922981b8b7cf8b20",
      "target": "解决办法：从提示词分布中采样。LLMPerf 使用 `--mean-input-tokens 500 --stddev-input-tokens 150`，使长度和内容都具有多样性。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "17-22:b0032",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Load Testing LLM APIs — Why k6 and Locust Lie",
        "## The Concept",
        "### The prompt-uniformity trap"
      ],
      "ordinal": 16,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "17-22:b0033",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Load Testing LLM APIs — Why k6 and Locust Lie",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Four load patterns"
      ],
      "ordinal": 17,
      "source_sha256": "534413702bcdbc6263569e519800f7c5bd445580a85ea8ce682b9906f32e152c",
      "target": "### 四种负载模式\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "17-22:b0034",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Load Testing LLM APIs — Why k6 and Locust Lie",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Four load patterns"
      ],
      "ordinal": 17,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "17-22:b0035",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Load Testing LLM APIs — Why k6 and Locust Lie",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Four load patterns"
      ],
      "ordinal": 18,
      "source_sha256": "56063a569e257aa06ca33ceff25aedaf49b6c9009eb68785487e04c52d106ef3",
      "target": "1. **稳态（steady-state）**：维持恒定 RPS（每秒请求数）运行 30-60 min。用于发现基线性能退化。\n2. **渐增（ramp）**：将 RPS 从 0 线性增加到目标值，历时 15 min。用于发现容量临界点和预热异常。\n3. **突增（spike）**：RPS 突然增至原来的 3-10x，持续 2 min 后恢复。用于发现自动扩缩容延迟、队列饱和及冷启动的影响。\n4. **长时间稳态运行（soak）**：维持稳态运行 4-8 hours。用于发现内存泄漏、连接池漂移和可观测性系统的溢出。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "17-22:b0036",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Load Testing LLM APIs — Why k6 and Locust Lie",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Four load patterns"
      ],
      "ordinal": 18,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
