        "### 2026 tool mapping"
      ],
      "ordinal": 19,
      "source_sha256": "79f2d4c3ba9926744fe0a54ca2acf573e3827f04ae9b8d58dfb0c554915aec89",
      "target": "### 2026 年的工具分工\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "17-22:b0038",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Load Testing LLM APIs — Why k6 and Locust Lie",
        "## The Concept",
        "### 2026 tool mapping"
      ],
      "ordinal": 19,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "17-22:b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Load Testing LLM APIs — Why k6 and Locust Lie",
        "## The Concept",
        "### 2026 tool mapping"
      ],
      "ordinal": 20,
      "source_sha256": "b04434c76022a3797dfaa22263ad0bce2bb35182aca0cf127d45a2d0d41cba20",
      "target": "**LLMPerf**（Anyscale）：用 Python 编写，但分词由 Rust 实现。支持按均值/标准差生成提示词，支持流式测量，是进行性能测试时的首选默认工具。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "17-22:b0040",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
