        "## The Concept",
        "### 2026 tool mapping"
      ],
      "ordinal": 20,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "17-22:b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Load Testing LLM APIs — Why k6 and Locust Lie",
        "## The Concept",
        "### 2026 tool mapping"
      ],
      "ordinal": 21,
      "source_sha256": "ffff65230fd6ac18a586bfa544a948d07bef407bf7e9fd7d8b8e40a94495cf5b",
      "target": "**NVIDIA GenAI-Perf**：NVIDIA 的参考工具。使用 Triton 客户端，指标覆盖全面。注意，它的 ITL（token 间延迟）不包含 TTFT，而 LLMPerf 的包含。因此，对同一台服务器，两种工具会给出不同的 TPOT（每个输出 token 的耗时）。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "17-22:b0042",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Load Testing LLM APIs — Why k6 and Locust Lie",
        "## The Concept",
        "### 2026 tool mapping"
      ],
      "ordinal": 21,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "17-22:b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Load Testing LLM APIs — Why k6 and Locust Lie",
        "## The Concept",
        "### 2026 tool mapping"
      ],
      "ordinal": 22,
      "source_sha256": "7328f41f626428179f618c092cdb26382e76a6cf026147e4d6d2a8e0fca9602f",
      "target": "**LLM-Locust**（TrueFoundry）：解决 GIL 陷阱的 Locust 扩展。保留熟悉的 Locust DSL（领域专用语言），并加入流式指标。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "17-22:b0044",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Load Testing LLM APIs — Why k6 and Locust Lie",
        "## The Concept",
